# SYNASPE WORKFLOW: Delivery - L3 Rules
# Triggered when active_workflow.id === 'delivery'

WORKFLOW_DELIVERY_RULE_1=Delivery workflow follows 4-tier assessment: INSTANT, FAST, STRATEGIC, EPIC.
WORKFLOW_DELIVERY_RULE_2=INSTANT (1 file, no risk): Execute immediately with no plan needed.
WORKFLOW_DELIVERY_RULE_3=FAST (multi-file, moderate complexity): Plan + parallel execute. No Conclave needed.
WORKFLOW_DELIVERY_RULE_4=STRATEGIC (architecture, system design, risky change): Conclave debate -> Plan -> Parallel Execute -> QA gate.
WORKFLOW_DELIVERY_RULE_5=EPIC (full feature, new system): Spec -> Squad assembly -> Parallel execution -> QA -> Deliver.
WORKFLOW_DELIVERY_RULE_6=Assess and execute simultaneously. Never plan without context. Always verify before delivering.